MIGRATION_V9 deleting stale lower_band_projection work items with a logged warning (AC-0.4 architecture-risk)\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/shared-tech/scheduler.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"ThreadDbOpener injected (OpResult<DatabaseSync>) so shared-tech does not import the threads domain (AC-0.6)\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/shared-tech/prompts/index.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"Registry key lower_band_projection→smooth_turn_compression; DEFAULT_PROMPT_NAMES inference-only\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/shared-tech/{report,work-queue/index,logging/index,classify}.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"DerivationType→string consumers; sibling import paths\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/threads/internal/create.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"Wired MIGRATION_V9 as version 9 in the thread-file migration history\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/turns/{index,internal/derive,internal/derivations,internal/recovery,internal/chunk-recovery}.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"Rename consumers (smooth_turn_compression/compressSmoothTurn), DerivationType→string, import path rewrites\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/messages/{index,internal/cascade,internal/derivations}.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"Rename + DerivationType→string + import path rewrites\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/thread-view/internal/render.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"Band fallback ladder renamed to smooth_turn_compression\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/{inspect,intake-stream,thread-view,threads}/internal/*.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"Rewrote stale ../../../shared/ and ../../../tech-utils/ import paths to ../../shared-tech/ (AC-0.1/0.2 fallout)\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/scripts/check-boundaries.mjs\",\n        \"reason\": \"Rewritten for the flat layout: domains are src/<domain>/