orted by ~15 consumers after its removal, the lower_band_projection→smooth_turn_compression rename unfinished, composeTurnRendering dropped from the inference adapter, the scheduler ThreadDbOpener return type wrong, and resolveInferenceProvider using prompt-template names as derivation-type keys while rejecting (instead of default-filling) missing inference types. Fixed all of it: rewrote every stale import to shared-tech/, replaced all DerivationType usages with string (fixtures now own the local derivation-type list), completed the rename in code/schema/prompts, restored composeTurnRendering, corrected ThreadDbOpener to OpResult<DatabaseSync>, and rewrote construction to validate per-key against DEFAULT_INFERENCE_ASSIGNMENTS, fill inference-type defaults (codex/gpt-5.4-mini) and guard defaults, and accept partial/deterministic-optional configs. Added MIGRATION_V9 (deletes stale lower_band_projection work items, logs a warning) wired into the thread-file history. Rewrote the boundary checker for the flat layout and exported checkSource for direct rule testing. Wrote restructure-boundaries.test.ts (11) and assignment-config.test.ts (8), updated existing tests/fixtures for the rename + new validation semantics + schema v9, re-recorded the red-manifest, updated 01-tech-arch.md §System Shape, and corrected stale comments. Three self-review passes: pass 1 fixed two stale comments and the self-referential manifest hash; pass 2 verified every Story-0 TC maps to a named passing test (no missing evidence); pass 3 confirmed no load-bearing placeholders, confirmed scheduler injection, and surfaced one transitional production-path behavior for handoff.\",\n    \"changedFiles\": [\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/sdk.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"Construction: per-key validation against prompt registry + deterministic types, default-assignment fill for inference types (AC-6.2/6.4), resolveGuards for guard defaults, openThreadDatabase injected into drainDeps\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/shared-tech/inference-types.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"ModelAssignment target ratios (AC-6.1), DerivationGuards (input-size cap lives here per TDQ-7), optional assignments, DEFAULT_GUARDS + resolveGuards (AC-6.2)\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/shared-tech/derivation.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"Removed DERIVATION_TYPES/DerivationType (AC-0.3); projectLowerBand→compressSmoothTurn; corrected stale boundary comment\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/shared-tech/inference-adapter.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"Restored composeTurnRendering; projectLowerBand→compressSmoothTurn + kind string smooth_turn_compression\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/shared-tech/deterministic.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"Method rename to compressSmoothTurn (deterministic output marker retained as internal test-double text)\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/shared-tech/storage.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"V5 backfill renamed to smooth_turn_compression; added MIGRATION_V9 deleting stale lower_band_projection work items with a logged warning (AC-0.4 architecture-risk)\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/shared-tech/scheduler.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"ThreadDbOpener injected (OpResult<DatabaseSync>) so shared-tech does not import the threads domain (AC-0.6)\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/shared-tech/prompts/index.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"Registry key lower_band_projection→smooth_turn_compression; DEFAULT_PROMPT_NAMES inference-only; removed stale TODO\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/shared-tech/context.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"Corrected stale boundary-rule comment (shared-tech/, top-level domains)\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/shared-tech/{report,work-queue/index,logging/index,classify}.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"DerivationType→string consumers; sibling import paths\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/threads/internal/create.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"Wired MIGRATION_V9 as version 9 in the thread-file migration history\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/turns/{index,internal/derive,internal/derivations,internal/recovery,internal/chunk-recovery}.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"Rename consumers (smooth_turn_compression/compressSmoothTurn), DerivationType→string, import path rewrites\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/messages/{index,internal/cascade,internal/derivations}.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"Rename + DerivationType→string + import path rewrites\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/thread-view/internal/render.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"Band fallback ladder renamed to smooth_turn_compression\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/src/{inspect,intake-stream,thread-view,threads}/internal/*.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"Rewrote stale ../../../shared/ and ../../../tech-utils/ import paths to ../../shared-tech/ (AC-0.1/0.2 fallout)\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/scripts/check-boundaries.mjs\",\n        \"reason\": \"Rewritten for the flat layout: domains are src/<domain>/, shared-tech replaces shared/tech-utils/inference/providers; enforces shared-tech↛domains and no cross-domain internal (AC-0.6); exports checkSource\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/scripts/check-boundaries.d.mts\",\n        \"reason\": \"NEW type declarations so tests can import checkSource\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/test/restructure-boundaries.test.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"NEW — 11 tests: TC-0.1a/0.2a/0.4a/0.6a/0.6b + checker-rule cases + the stale-work-item V9 migration\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/test/assignment-config.test.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"NEW — 8 tests: TC-0.3a/0.3b/6.1a/6.2a/6.3a/6.4a + default-guard fill/override\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/test/fixtures/model-call.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"Owns the local DERIVATION_TYPES/DerivationType list; validAssignments maps deterministic prompts; path fixes\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/test/fixtures/{index,seam-conformance,threads,work-handlers,view-seam,intake-seam,legacy,provider-double,openrouter-call}.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"Path rewrites (shared-tech/), DerivationType sourced from fixtures, rename\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/test/{inference-construction,inference-adapter,inference-prompts,inference-real,retirement,thread-migration,view-fixture}.test.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"Validation-semantics rewrite (missing kinds no longer error), provenance assertion, guard config, schema v9, export-surface list\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/test/{turns,mutations,mutations-delete,view-sweep,chunk-compact-recovery,turn-cascade,smoothing-recovery,derivation-messages,derivation-turns,inference-classification,inference-routing,inspect-*,work-queue,work-execution*,tool-result-rendering,view-pull,fixtures,logging-surface,report-repair}.test.ts\",\n        \"reason\": \"lower_band_projection→smooth_turn_compression and projectLowerBand→compressSmoothTurn across assertions/fixtures\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"packages/lhc/test/red-manifest.json\",\n        \"reason\": \"Re-recorded to the post-rename baseline (80 entries) so the green-phase immutability guard holds\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/01-tech-arch.md\",\n        \"reason\": \"§System Shape updated: top-level domains, shared-tech consolidation, AC-0.6 boundary rules, lower-band→smooth-turn rename\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"tests\": {\n      \"added\": [\n        \"test/restructure-boundaries.test.ts (11 tests)\",\n        \"test/assignment-config.test.ts (8 tests)\"\n      ],\n      \"modified\": [\n        \"test/inference-construction.test.ts (validation semantics)\",\n        \"test/inference-adapter.test.ts (provenance)\",\n        \"test/inference-prompts.test.ts (guards + golden iteration)\",\n        \"test/inference-real.test.ts\",\n        \"test/retirement.test.ts (export surface)\",\n        \"test/thread-migration.test.ts (schema v9)\",\n        \"test/view-fixture.test.ts (schema v9)\",\n        \"test/fixtures/model-call.ts + 8 other fixtures\",\n        \"~20 assertion tests (rename)\"\n      ],\n      \"removed\": [],\n      \"totalAfterStory\": 452,\n      \"deltaFromPriorBaseline\": 19\n    },\n    \"gatesRun\": [\n      {\n        \"command\": \"pnpm run verify\",\n        \"result\": \"pass\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"command\": \"pnpm run green-verify\",\n        \"result\": \"pass\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"command\": \"pnpm run verify-all\",\n        \"result\": \"pass\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"selfReview\": {\n      \"passesRun\": 3,\n      \"findingsFixed\": [\n        \"30 files had stale relative imports (../../../shared/, ../../../tech-utils/, ../../shared/, ./types.js) left after the folder moves — rewrote all to shared-tech/.\",\n        \"DerivationType was removed from derivation.ts but ~15 consumers still imported it — replaced all with string; fixtures now own the local derivation-type list.\",\n        \"composeTurnRendering was accidentally dropped from the inference adapter (6 methods → 5) — restored; it is removed in Story 3/4 with the deterministic provider ops, not Story 0.\",\n        \"scheduler ThreadDbOpener was typed (path)→DatabaseSync but openThreadDatabase returns OpResult<DatabaseSync>, breaking the injected call site — corrected the type.\",\n        \"resolveInferenceProvider used PROMPT_NAMES (prompt-template names) as derivation-type keys and rejected missing inference types — rewrote to validate against DEFAULT_INFERENCE_ASSIGNMENTS keys and fill defaults (AC-6.2/6.4).\",\n        \"Extract<string, literal-union> evaluated to never after DerivationType→string in chunk-recovery — replaced with the explicit literal union.\",\n        \"record-red-manifest had captured red-manifest.json's own hash, making it self-stale — removed the self-entry.\",\n        \"Self-review pass 1: two src comments still read 'shared/ may not import domains/' after the restructure — corrected in context.ts and derivation.ts.\",\n        \"Self-review pass 2: verified every Story-0 TC (0.1a/0.2a/0.3a/0.3b/0.4a/0.5a/0.6a/0.6b/6.1a/6.2a/6.3a/6.4a) maps to a named passing test and both architecture-risk tests have coverage; no missing evidence.\",\n        \"Self-review pass 3: confirmed no load-bearing placeholders/TODOs in src (grep hits are legitimate SQL '?' placeholders or unrelated comments) and confirmed the scheduler openThreadDatabase injection is wired; no further fixes.\"\n      ],\n      \"findingsSurfaced\": [\n        \"Prompt file lower-band-v1.ts is intentionally NOT renamed to smooth-turn-compression-v1.ts: the registry KEY was renamed (smooth_turn_compression), but the tested prompt content is Story 3's deliverable (AC-1.2), so renaming the file now would mislabel placeholder content. AC-0.4 is satisfied via the type-string rename (TC-0.4a passes).\",\n        \"Deterministic prompt files turn-compose-v1 and chunk-detailed-v1 remain in the prompt registry — their removal is coupled with removing composeTurnRendering/summarizeChunkDetailed from the DerivationProvider interface, which is Story 3/4 scope (the handlers still route them through the provider in Story 0).\",\n        \"The deterministic provider output marker stays \\\"projection\\\" while the method was renamed compressSmoothTurn; the marker is internal test-double text that no AC covers and that inference-adapter/fixtures tests pin.\",\n        \"AC-6.1's 'input-size cap alongside provider/model/prompt' is resolved by tech-design TDQ-7 to live on DerivationGuards.smoothedPrompt.maxInferenceTokens rather than on ModelAssignment; implementation follows the resolved design and TC-6.1a/TC-6.2a cover both the target ratios (assignment) and the cap (guards).\",\n        \"Production-path transitional behavior (handoff note): a default-only inference config (inference: { call } with no explicit assignments) fills the four inference-type defaults but will not fully drain turn_derivation, because the unchanged Epic 05 handler still calls composeTurnRendering and turn_rendering has no default assignment (it is a deterministic type per AC-6.3/6.4). This is unchanged handler behavior, not a regression — Epic 05 hosts always supplied full assignments — and it resolves when deterministic ops leave the provider interface in Story 3/4. TC-6.4a correctly scopes its assertion to the inference ops.\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"openQuestions\": [],\n    \"specDeviations\": [\n      \"Prompt module lower-band-v1.ts not renamed to smooth-turn-compression-v1.ts (only the registry key and derivation-type string were renamed). Deferred to Story 3, which installs the tested prompt content and can rename the module then. TC-0.4a (schema/source use smooth_turn_compression, no derivation-type references under the old name) passes.\"\n    ],\n    \"recommendedNextStep\": \"Proceed to verification, then Story 1 (Smoothed-prompt guards). The foundation — flat domain layout, shared-tech consolidation, smooth_turn_compression type, default assignments, guard defaults, enforced boundaries, and the stale-work migration — is in place for Stories 1–5. (Handoff: Story 3/4 should move composeTurnRendering/summarizeChunkDetailed off the provider so a default-only config fully drains, completing AC-6.3's 'not invoked' half.)\"\n  },\n  \"errors\": [],\n  \"warnings\": [],\n  \"artifacts\": [\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"self-review-pass\",\n      \"path\": \"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/07-derivation-dial-in/artifacts/00-foundation/007-self-review-pass-1.json\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"self-review-pass\",\n      \"path\": \"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/07-derivation-dial-in/artifacts/00-foundation/008-self-review-pass-2.json\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"self-review-pass\",\n      \"path\": \"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/07-derivation-dial-in/artifacts/00-foundation/009-self-review-pass-3.json\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"kind\": \"result-envelope\",\n      \"path\": \"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/07-derivation-dial-in/artifacts/00-foundation/010-self-review-batch.json\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"startedAt\": \"2026-06-18T16:53:35.171Z\",\n  \"finishedAt\": \"2026-06-18T17:02:42.371Z\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
